RANDED -> \"alpha\" (C19S); no final state differs. cf-fed95cab816ff9a6 (test_diff) is the intended #9057 test flip. mcdc_diff and removed_behavior report none.\n\n**Questions for a human.** Approve or reject each compat finding. Does every execDetached write start under a real burst (not run live)? Do bin/ callers treat a superseded exit 1 as Escape? Peer death still strands a caller (KI open).\n\n**Other disclosures.** changed_files_out_of_scope (informs): the #9057 reproducer script test/reports/report-cmulr95nw0kqr1gw46i7f50xj.sh is outside the verification scope by design; no changed file is unmapped. effects_unavailable: change effects were not analyzed (QML). checks_skipped: 13 checks skipped by configuration.\n\n**Readiness** is not_assessed; next decision human_judgement (compat_changes_unapproved, 17 changes), reviewer authority. Nothing here is an approval."}
